('LR-B03',['UN-21'],'Base-only waiver','A legal replay’s ordinary base RP is3 and its actual present surcharge is1.','The replay’s base waiver leaves1RP payable plus any other genuine additional costs, not0. The earlier Echo Cast arming was a separate paid Action. A saved original damage die is not reused.'),
