('LRE-08','All wrapper, portal and reflection histories','Cantrip composite payload-ID cadence; later Quick Cast Bonus Action not a second same-turn BA; Delay arming/payload/concentration/release revalidation and one counter chain; Echo base-only waiver; one root reflection; illegal return, mirror pairing, consent/type/range and owner continuity. No recursive refund or free action.'),
